## 9. Conclusion

This architecture provides a complete, robust, type-safe blueprint for Milestone M1 of OpenFlightReader Phase 3. The design resolves all asynchronous sensor fusion challenges, guarantees monotonic millisecond timestamping across flight phases, and ensures safety-critical landmark event preservation during decimation.
